{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "macros.html.j2" as m %}
{% import "paper_macros.html.j2" as pm %}
{% set seats = seating.seats %}
{% block title %}Agents{% endblock %}
{% block toc %}
{{ m.toc_group("The council, in order") }}
{% for s in seats %}{{ m.toc_item("ag-" ~ s.slug, s.name, s.accent, s.worst) }}{% endfor %}
{% if seating.machinery %}{{ m.toc_group("Machinery") }}{{ m.toc_item("machinery", "Code officers", "neutral") }}{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
{% block toc_foot %}<p class="toc-legend">The mark is the seat's worst status over the published meetings.</p>{{ m.toc_legend() }}{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}
<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Agents</p>
  <h1>Who sits at the table, and what each one did last</h1>
  <p class="lede">One card per seat, in the order a decision flows. In the {% if swing_agents %}<a href="../swing/index.html">swing book</a>{% else %}swing book{% endif %} (short trades on the news) the Scout pitches ideas and the Skeptic checks them blind; the bull and the bear argue both the core portfolio and the swing ideas; the manager decides both; two analysts add evidence; code checks every limit; and a person approves every live order. Paper decisions are the current record: real data and agents, nothing traded.</p>
</header>
{% endblock %}
{% block main %}

{% set okp = (100.0 * llm_ok / llm_calls) if llm_calls else none %}
<dl class="strip strip-agents">
  <div class="st"><dt>{{ icon("users") }}Seats</dt><dd class="st-v">{{ seats | length }}</dd><dd class="st-sub">plus {{ plural(seating.machinery | length, "code officer") }} below</dd></div>
  <div class="st"><dt>{{ icon("cpu") }}Model</dt><dd class="st-v st-v-sm st-model"><code>{{ model or "—" }}</code></dd><dd class="st-sub">the council's language-model seats · thinking {{ "on" if think else "off" }}; the Skeptic runs on another model family</dd></div>
  <div class="st st-ring"><dt>{{ icon("circle-check") }}Usable replies</dt><dd>{{ m.pring(okp, ring_css(okp), (llm_ok ~ " of " ~ llm_calls ~ " calls usable") if llm_calls else "no calls yet") }}</dd><dd class="st-v st-v-sm">{{ llm_ok }} <span class="st-of">of {{ llm_calls | count }} calls</span></dd></div>
  <div class="st"><dt>{{ icon("list-checks") }}Meetings</dt><dd class="st-v">{{ meetings_count }}</dd><dd class="st-sub">{{ paper_count }} paper · {{ cycles_count }} live or rehearsal</dd></div>
</dl>

<section class="card accent-neutral" id="seats" aria-labelledby="seats-h">
<h2 id="seats-h"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>The council, seat by seat</h2>
<p class="small">Each card says what the seat reads, what it may decide and what it said at its last meeting, with the outcome. {{ pm.badge() }} marks a paper decision.</p>
<ol class="seats">
{% for s in seats %}
  <li class="seat-card accent-{{ s.accent }}" id="ag-{{ s.slug }}">
    <div class="sc-head">
      {{ m.avatar(s.icon, s.accent) }}
      <div class="sc-title">
        <h3 class="sc-name"><a href="{{ s.page }}">{{ s.name }}</a></h3>
        <p class="sc-sub"><span class="node-kind kind-{{ s.kind | lower }}">{{ s.kind }}</span>{% if s.slug in ("scout", "skeptic") %} · swing book{% elif s.also %} · core and swing{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <span class="sc-n" aria-label="Step {{ loop.index }} of {{ seats | length }}">{{ loop.index }}</span>
    </div>
    <dl class="sc-rows">
      <div><dt>Reads</dt><dd>{{ s.reads }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Decides</dt><dd>{{ s.decides }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Last call</dt><dd>{% if s.last %}<span class="sc-said">{{ s.last.text | plain_terms }}</span>
        <span class="sc-out">{{ m.chip(s.last.chip) }} <a class="sc-dec" href="{{ s.last.href }}">{% if s.last.no %}decision #{{ s.last.no }}{% else %}the run{% endif %}</a>{% if s.last.kind == "paper" %} {{ pm.badge() }}{% endif %}</span>{% else %}<span class="muted">Not at a published meeting yet.</span>{% endif %}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    {% if s.record %}<p class="sc-rec">{{ s.record }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="sc-rel">{{ s.rel.text }}{% if s.rel.fails %}<span class="sc-fails"><span class="sc-fail sc-fw">Failed: {{ s.rel.fail_words }}</span>{% for f in s.rel.fails[:3] %}<span class="sc-fail">{{ icon(status_icon(f.css)) }}{{ f.word }}: {{ f.what }} (<a href="{{ f.href }}">{% if f.no %}#{{ f.no }}{% else %}{{ f.when }}{% endif %}</a>)</span>{% endfor %}{% if s.rel.fails | length > 3 %}<span class="sc-fail">and {{ s.rel.fails | length - 3 }} more on its page</span>{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}</p>
    {% if s.also %}<p class="sc-also"><a href="{{ s.also.href }}">Its swing-book page: {{ s.also.name }} →</a></p>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>
</section>

{% if seating.machinery %}
<section class="card accent-neutral" id="machinery" aria-labelledby="machinery-h">
<h2 id="machinery-h"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>Machinery</h2>
<p class="small">Code that builds the facts, audits and prices the decision, and a lone language-model control that never trades. What each did at the last meeting:</p>
<ul class="mach">
{% for a in seating.machinery %}
  <li><a class="mach-a" href="{{ a.page }}">{{ m.avatar(a.icon, a.accent, "sm") }}<span class="mach-text"><span class="mach-name">{{ a.name }} <span class="node-kind kind-{{ a.kind | lower }}">{{ a.kind }}</span></span><span class="mach-job">{{ a.job }}</span>{% if a.said %}<span class="mach-said">Last: {{ a.said }}</span>{% endif %}</span></a></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
</section>
{% endif %}

<p class="small muted">Usable counts a call whose reply could be used, including one fixed by its single correction turn. Counts include paper and live meetings. A failure links to its meeting; the error text itself is never published, only a fixed code in words.</p>
{% endblock %}
